  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>P</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>21</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>21</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>42</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now on comparing both side we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>So, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p>"
  }
